### Hent alle investeringscases
GET http://localhost:3000/api/investment-cases

### Hent én case (kun grunddata)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/investment-cases/1

### Hent én case med ALLE tilknyttede linjer i ét kald
GET http://localhost:3000/api/investment-cases/1/full

### Opret en investeringscase
POST http://localhost:3000/api/investment-cases
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ejendomId": 1,
  "navn": "Standard case",
  "beskrivelse": "Første simple investeringscase"
}

### Duplikér en case (kopierer omkostninger, finansiering, renoveringer, drift, udlejning)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/investment-cases/1/duplicate
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Opdater navn og beskrivelse
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/investment-cases/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "navn": "Plan A",
  "beskrivelse": "Opdateret beskrivelse"
}

### Slet en case
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/investment-cases/1
